<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>’Tis the blood Thou shedd’st for us,</l><l>That our sins may be forgiv’n;</l><l>’Tis the cov’nant made for us,</l><l>That Thy blessings may be giv’n.</l><l>Thou didst drink the cup of wrath,</l><l>Thou hast tasted death for us,</l><l>Thus the cup of blessing bought,</l><l>As the portion gained for us.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>In this portion we have God,</l><l>Whom we lost thru Adam’s fall;</l><l>By the shedding of Thy blood,</l><l>God becomes our all in all.</l><l>In this portion all we have—</l><l>Life and peace, redemption sure;</l><l>All that God has planned and willed,</l><l>In this portion we secure.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>An eternal portion, ’tis,</l><l>Overflowing cup divine;</l><l>Heav’nly taste do we enjoy</l><l>In this cup of God’s design.</l><l>Here in love we drink this cup</l><l>In remembrance, Lord, of Thee;</l><l>Thus in spirit we partake</l><l>All Thy work on Calvary.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
